  "instructions": [
    "Combine pine nuts, water, almond milk, date syrup, coconut oil, cinnamon, ginger, and salt in a saucepan. Bring to a boil, then reduce the heat to a simmer and poach for 5 minutes.",
    "Remove the saucepan from the heat and let it steep for 5 minutes.",
    "Strain the poaching liquid through a fine-mesh sieve into a bowl, discarding the solids.",
    "Stir in lemon juice and let the mixture cool to room temperature.",
    "Stir in chopped parsley and serve chilled.",
    "Serve warm or chilled.",
    "Serve as a festive dessert or snack.",
    "Garnish with additional parsley if desired."
